{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "一次函数 y=3x-2 的斜率与截距",
    "goals": [
      "指出 -2 不是斜率，辨析斜截式中斜率 k 与截距 b 的不同含义",
      "通过爬坡比喻直观理解斜率是变化率：向右 1 单位，向上 3 单位"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "认可敢于尝试的态度，精准指出把斜率与常数项截距混淆的点",
        "使用贯穿的山路爬坡比喻：截距是出发的高度，斜率是每向右一步上升的坡度",
        "用直观函数图像动态调节斜率，对比验证"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 3,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "斜率 k",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.04
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "拖动滑块，把斜率 k 调到 1，观察坡度是如何变平缓的：",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "找到标有“斜率 k”的滑杆",
          "向右拖动直到数值显示为 1"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！斜率为 1 时，向右走 1 格刚好上升 1 格，坡度比 3 缓和多啦！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 1,
          "tolerance": 0.02
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "辨析斜率与截距：得出斜率是3，-2是截距，并通过山路坡度体验变化率",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "敢算就很棒！不过这里的斜率不是 -2，而是 3。你抓到了式子里的关键数字，只卡在了一步：把常数项和 x 前面的系数搞混了！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "一次函数 y=3x-2 的斜率与截距",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = kx + b \\implies y = 3x - 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "在斜截式 y=kx+b 中，x 前面的数字 k 才是斜率，后面的常数项 b 叫做截距。我们把这条线想象成一段山路：-2 代表你在 y 轴上的出发高度，也就是海拔 -2 米。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "两者的分工",
                "items": [
                  "斜率 k = 3：决定山路的坡度（每向右1步，上升3格）",
                  "截距 b = -2：决定起跑点（与y轴交于点 (0, -2)）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "现在看屏幕上的直线 y=n1*x-2。当斜率是 3 时，我们沿着山路向右走 1 个单位，高度就往上升了整整 3 个单位！如果像你刚才猜的斜率是 -2，山路可就是向下走的了，我演示给你看。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线 y = kx - 2",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -20,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((number_01)*(x))-(2)",
                    "label": "y = kx - 2"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": -2,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "((number_01)*(0))-(2)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "((number_01)*(1))-(2)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "你看，斜率变成 -2 之后，向右走反而是往下降 2 格，整个山路就变成下坡了！所以原本式子 y=3x-2 的坡度，其实是稳稳上扬的 3。课后你可以亲自把滑块调回 1，看看坡度变得平缓时的样子！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察直线倾斜方向的变化",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在一次函数 y=kx+b 中，x 前面的系数 k 是斜率（表示倾斜程度和变化率），常数项 b 是 y 轴上的截距（表示与 y 轴交点的位置）。对于 y=3x-2，斜率是 3，截距是 -2。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
